up an open door!

262
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:42,160
-Ooh, let KVN help!
-God almighty, KVN!

263
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,370
You can't just phantom
up on me like that!

264
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,670
Don't worry about me,
I am helping.

265
00:11:46,700 --> 00:11:49,400
Oh, oh. KVN, you did
something right!

266
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,740
Ohh!

267
00:11:50,770 --> 00:11:53,940
KVN, you processed
horrendous mess of wires!

268
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:57,550
Lord Commander: Your vessel
has been subjected

269
00:11:57,580 --> 00:12:00,120
to a search
for specimen E-351.

270
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:03,250
Come forward...or die.

271
00:12:03,290 --> 00:12:04,350
Oh, crap.

272
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:11,460
♪♪

273
00:12:11,490 --> 00:12:14,460
My arm, man!
Aaahh!

274
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,530
You fool!

275
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:17,930
Who the freak is this guy?

276
00:12:17,970 --> 00:12:19,630
I believe they want
the alien

277
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:21,270
you're hiding
in your backpack.

278
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:24,140
What? I don't know
what you're referring to.

279
00:12:27,340 --> 00:12:31,610
This is what I was meant to do!
I have never felt so alive!

280
00:12:31,650 --> 00:12:33,980
Oh! You mean
my underpants caddy.

281
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:38,550
Yes. We should comply
with their wishes, Gary.

282
00:12:38,590 --> 00:12:39,920
I don't know.

283
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,720
I kind of was starting
to like this little guy.

284
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,230
He gives great hugs.

285
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:46,830
Gary, we are not equipped
to face this threat.

286
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:54,800
-Good job, Avocato.
-This is not our fight.

287
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,510
HUE, we make it our fight.
You're Infinity Guard.

288
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,310
Your whole motto
is to protect life.

289
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:01,110
Is that life, Gary?

290
00:13:01,140 --> 00:13:03,750
Well, if it isn't, then I'm
a raging sack of walnuts!

291
00:13:03,780 --> 00:13:07,150
HUE, lightfold the ship!

292
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,980
This will lengthen
your sentence.

293
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:11,020
I get it.
Lightfold the ship, HUE!

294
00:13:11,050 --> 00:13:12,650
Gary.

295
00:13:12,690 --> 00:13:14,120
Do it!

296
00:13:17,730 --> 00:13:20,330
They're lightfolding!

297
00:13:23,730 --> 00:13:26,470
[ All yelling ]

298
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:29,170
[ Alarm blaring ]

299
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:37,880
♪♪

300
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:41,050
Proximity alert.
Proximity alert.

301
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,380
Is that what I think it is?

302
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:45,190
HUE, that's no good.
Get us out of here.

303
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:47,190
Lightfold again,
lightfold, lightfold!

304
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:48,320
We are immobilized

305
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,160
until the lightfold
engines cool.

306
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:54,200
The asteroids will reach
the ship in 29 seconds.

307
00:13:54,230 --> 00:13:55,830
Secure your helmet
immediately.

308
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:56,970
My helmet's in the airlock.

309
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,240
Run.
15 seconds until impact.

310
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:02,840
At your current pace,
you will not make it.

311
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:05,570
Oh, Gary will make it.

312
00:14:05,610 --> 00:14:06,880
Hey, Gary,
sorry, got a minute?

313
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:09,210
Yeah, I've been
thinking about...

314
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:11,380
[ Groans ]

315
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:14,050
Hyah!

316
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:18,220
Gary, two seconds.

317
00:14:18,250 --> 00:14:20,790
You're gonna live!
You're gonna live!

318
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:28,060
Sweet Grandor's glove!
Definitely gonna die this time!

319
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:34,500
HUE: Gary, you may
have a problem.

320
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:36,070
I seriously question
your usage of "may have."

321
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:39,670
I think we have reached have.
I am very deep in have!

322
00:14:39,710 --> 00:14:41,180
Due to
the moon's gravity,

323
00:14:41,210 --> 00:14:44,610
the asteroid field will swing
back to the Galaxy 1

324
00:14:44,650 --> 00:14:48,350
and then at you in
approximately 39 seconds.

325
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:49,680
That's no good, HUE.

326
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,250
Formulate me up
some solutions.

327
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:53,020
Calculating. Mm-hmm.

328
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:54,360
Mmm.

329
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:56,560
Mnh-mnh.

330
00:14:56,590 --> 00:14:57,690
Ahh.

331
00:14:57,730 --> 00:14:59,730
Gary, I do have a solution

332
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:02,400
with a 33% chance
of success.

333
00:15:02,430 --> 00:15:03,930
Okay, and that would be?

334
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:06,940
Perform an emergency air
blow-out of your O2 tanks.

335
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:08,770
If you can enter
the moon's orbit,

336
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:11,240
you might be able to
sling-hook around it

337
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:12,540
back to the Galaxy 1.

338
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:14,940
All right. All right,
let's do this.

339
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:16,880
Gary, you should know,

340
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:19,710
this calculation
will only work with you.

341
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:22,220
You will have to leave
the life-form behind.

342
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:23,390
Mooncake?

343
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:25,620
Or there is
zero probability

344
00:15:25,650 --> 00:15:28,820
you will make it back
to the Galaxy 1 alive.

345
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:31,430
I get it.
I'll scream at you.

346
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:32,830
Mooncake is coming with.

347
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:34,900
You will never
make it, Gary.

348
00:15:34,930 --> 00:15:38,130
Your only chance is to perform
this maneuver alone.

349
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:42,570
HUE, your lack of confidence
is positively depressing!

350
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,410
Blowing the air tank
in three...

351
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,570
Gary, please.

352
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:47,340
-Two...
-You will fail.

353
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:48,440
You're right.

354
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:51,450
I will fail...upwards.

355
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:57,750
♪♪

356
00:15:57,790 --> 00:16:00,460
Entering
into moon's orbit.

357
00:16:04,490 --> 00:16:07,100
Oh, no!
It's not working.

358
00:16:07,130 --> 00:16:08,830
At your current
rate of velocity,

359
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:12,170
you will not make it
back to the Galaxy 1.

360
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:18,340
♪♪

361
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:20,280
You have failed, Gary.

362
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:27,020
♪♪

363
00:16:27,050 --> 00:16:31,390
The asteroids will make
impact in five seconds.

364
00:16:34,090 --> 00:16:38,030
Four...

365
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:40,330
Three...

366
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:42,130
[ Beeping, steady beep ]

367
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:46,230
Two...

368
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:48,840
One.

369
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:56,310
♪♪

370
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:58,850
[ Chitters ]

371
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,010
It worked!

372
00:17:00,050 --> 00:17:01,320
[ Laughing ]

373
00:17:01,350 --> 00:17:03,020
HUE!
And you said I could die!

374
00:17:03,050 --> 00:17:04,220
Ha!

375
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:07,320
You were dead --
for five minutes.

376
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:08,690
Are you for serious?

377
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:11,160
I believe the life-form
saved your life.

378
00:17:11,190 --> 00:17:13,530
-Mooncake?
-Chocli, chocli.

379
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:15,360
Thank you for saving my life.

380
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:16,860
Wow.

381
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:19,830
I am detecting one unknown
life-form still aboard.

382
00:17:19,870 --> 00:17:21,870
He is armed.
-What deck?

383
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:25,340
4A. Sames
are already on route.

384
00:17:25,370 --> 00:17:30,510
♪♪

385
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:33,780
Hand over E-351.

386
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:38,590
Listen, buddy, I only have
one thing to say to you.

387
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:41,660
Do you play cards?

388
00:17:43,730 --> 00:17:46,130
I'm gonna take that
as a yes!

389
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,300
-Freeze!
-Oh, good Lord!

390
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:49,730
Oh, my gosh.

391
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:51,370
Just don't walk up on
somebody like that, Hank!

392
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,370
I'm gonna crap my pants.
I thought you were a baby ghost

393
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,870
or a ghost baby or something

394
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:57,140
in between the ghost
baby spectrum.

395
00:17:57,170 --> 00:17:58,310
-Freeze!
-Aagh!

396
00:17:58,340 --> 00:18:00,440
Gary:
Freakin' crap, Hank!

397
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:04,310
Isn't this great?
I mean, just us guys

398
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:07,920
sitting here,
chillin', playin' cards.

399
00:18:07,950 --> 00:18:09,750
[ Mumbling ]

400
00:18:09,780 --> 00:18:12,090
You really know how to
sling the zingers, cat guy.

401
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:13,460
The name's Avocato.

402
00:18:13,490 --> 00:18:15,760
No.
The name is loser!

403
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:18,730
Eat it!
Four of a kind!

404
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:19,990
You're oblivious
to this thing, aren't you?

405
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:21,260
-What?
-That.

406
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:22,430
-This?
-Yes! That.

407
00:18:22,460 --> 00:18:24,100
-Mooncake?
-What's a Mooncake?

408
00:18:24,130 --> 00:18:25,730
-This!
-That?

409
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:27,470
Yes, that.
Please tell me
you didn't name E-351.

410
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,500
-What's an E-3559?
-That.

411
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:31,840
-This?
-Yes, freakin' that!

412
00:18:31,870 --> 00:18:32,940
I suppose I did.

413
00:18:32,970 --> 00:18:34,610
You don't know
what that is, do you?

414
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:38,150
That is a planet-killer.

415
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:41,120
[ Laughing ]

416
00:18:41,150 --> 00:18:42,620
Are you hearing this?

417
00:18:42,650 --> 00:18:44,590
Freakin' guy thinks Mooncake
is a planet-killer!

418
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:47,020
What a freakin' --
oh, man!

419
00:18:47,050 --> 00:18:49,260
[ Laughing ]

420
00:18:49,290 --> 00:18:51,130
Shut your face hole,
KVN! Crap.

421
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,460
So you think
this is funny?

422
00:18:52,490 --> 00:18:54,000
I'm serious.
-Are you?

423
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:55,200
Yes. The Lord Commander

424
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:56,860
is searching
the galaxy for it.

425
00:18:56,900 --> 00:19:00,300
You can't hide.
Wherever you go, he'll find you.

426
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:03,470
Why should I believe you,
Mr. Whiskers?

427
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:05,810
Call me that again,
and I'll kill you.

428
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:08,510
Mm-hmm. I've insulted you.
You see, the truth is,

429
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:10,510
I've never socialized
with a cat man before.

430
00:19:10,550 --> 00:19:12,650
My neighbor had a cat.
Loved to lick himself.

431
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:14,020
You're not gonna do that,
right?

432
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:16,520
Otherwise, we're gonna
have problems, friend.

433
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:19,490
I'm not a cat,
I'm a Ventrexian.

434
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:22,320
Got it. See, I'm
a Presbyterian myself.

435
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:23,560
But I love all people.

436
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:25,830
Just how I was raised.
-We're in danger.

437
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:28,560
Listen, all of us
are in danger!

438
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:31,530
Mooncake, look into
Gary's gelatinous marbles.

439
00:19:31,570 --> 00:19:33,800
As long as I draw breath
and you provide me

440
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,800
with copious amounts
of adventure,

441
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:38,670
I will be there for you.
We're a team now.

442
00:19:38,710 --> 00:19:40,540
And I'll let you
be my sidekick and such

443
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:41,980
with a super
side order of what-not.

444
00:19:42,010 --> 00:19:43,310
HUE: Well said.

445
00:19:43,350 --> 00:19:44,550
[ Dings ]

446
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:47,650
A cookie -- for me?!

447
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,580
Yes, Gary. Take one.

448
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:51,020
You displayed a quality

449
00:19:51,050 --> 00:19:52,820
I hadn't seen in you
previously --

450
00:19:52,850 --> 00:19:55,690
courage. Exemplary.
You earned it.

451
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:58,030
And because
I am the captain.

452
00:19:58,060 --> 00:20:00,190
Cookie withdrawn.

453
00:20:00,230 --> 00:20:01,360
Aah!

454
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:04,030
The penitent man
shall pass.

455
00:20:04,070 --> 00:20:06,270
Ohh!
I got one!

456
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:08,370
Sweet Grandor's glove,

457
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:11,340
I got
a mother-loving cookie!

458
00:20:11,370 --> 00:20:13,110
Gary:
This is a cookie, Quinn.

459
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:15,780
HUE said I earned it
because I did things, Quinn.

460
00:20:15,810 --> 00:20:19,680
Dangerous things.
Cookie-earning things.

461
00:20:19,710 --> 00:20:23,590
Now to eat the fruits
of my greatness.

462
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:27,690
-Mine!
-What? No!

463
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:30,560
KVN! Oh, KVN!

464
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:37,100
Gary? Gary? Gary?!

465
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:40,070
Gary? Gary. Gary!

466
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,400
Gary, are you sleeping?

467
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:42,970
Wah-pa!

468
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,470
Oh, okay. We're good.
Don't mind me.

469
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:47,480
I'm -- I'm just
floating this way.

470
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:49,040
This is the way
I like to go.

471
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:52,610
Bye! This was my plan.
That's my path.

472
00:20:52,650 --> 00:20:53,920
[ Laughs ]

473
00:20:53,950 --> 00:21:04,730
♪♪

474
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:07,930
Lord Commander:
All the pieces are in place.

475
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:12,270
Let's play a little.
